0b0144e2c644","text":"平底鑊中火炒熟煙肉，不另加食油。","step_no":3,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"ae8896a9-a3c5-4bfa-b886-fbf25fa3192e","time_seconds":180},{"id":"3316d55a-fe6b-41ae-9095-b7da89fab061","text":"加入意粉及部分預留煮麵水，拌勻後關火並移離爐面。","step_no":4,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"ae8896a9-a3c5-4bfa-b886-fbf25fa3192e","time_seconds":90},{"id":"e78b9b52-2876-41c9-8f6a-e81ab428dafe","text":"加入蛋芝士液，立即快速拌勻；這個做法不保證蛋液全熟，不能以普通生蛋代替。","step_no":5,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"ae8896a9-a3c5-4bfa-b886-fbf25fa3192e","time_seconds":90},{"id":"b2ad9808-20c2-417c-b1ea-46620ea8c3c5","text":"逐少加入餘下預留煮麵水調整濃稠度，加入黑椒後即食；巴士德消毒蛋須按包裝冷藏於4°C或以下。","step_no":6,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"ae8896a9-a3c5-4bfa-b886-fbf25fa3192e","time_seconds":60}],"recipe":{"name":"卡邦尼意粉","description":"卡邦尼意粉以煙肉、雞蛋和巴馬臣芝士拌成濃郁醬汁，香濃飽肚。","calories_per_serving":739,"protein_g":32.9,"carbs_g":75.9,"fat_g":32.3,"diet":[],"flavor":["salty"],"protein":["pork","egg"],"primary_protein":"pork","source_data":{"consistency_review":{"date":"2026-10-25","scope":"remaining_31_ingredient_and_nutrition_repair","status":"resolved_by_disclosed_reformulation","original_source_verified":false,"nutrition_validated":false,"public_notes":["本版為重新整理的家庭配方，並非已尋回原始食譜；新增及調整用量已列入材料表，尚未試煮。"]},"repair_20261025":{"status":"editorial_reformulation_not_recovered_original","reference_role":"Comparison and method only; quantities are explicitly edited, not claimed to be exact source adaptations.","references":["https://www.cfs.gov.hk/tc_chi/multimedia/multimedia_pub/multimedia_pub_fsf_174_02.html"],"previous_review":{"date":"2026-10-25","scope":"full_legacy_text_consistency","status":"pending_evidence","public_notes":["原始食譜來源及營養依據尚未核實；本輪只核對材料表與文字的一致性，並非試煮或完整營養驗證。","蛋醬以離火餘溫拌成，未列巴士德消毒蛋或蛋醬熟度驗證；高風險人士及非全熟蛋的適用性待核。"],"nutrition_validated":false,"original_source_verified":false},"ingredient_changes":[{"before":{"id":"823de246-d765-482f-b8f5-e1f5af3574c1","name":"雞蛋","note":"打散","slug":"egg","unit":"egg","optional":false,"quantity":1},"after":{"id":"823de246-d765-482f-b8f5-e1f5af