04e939e4","time_seconds":180},{"id":"f685f677-b601-4f17-8ae3-17c2c8ee1b51","text":"免治豬肉加入少許鹽和白胡椒拌勻，醃約 10 分鐘。","step_no":2,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"789c4dc7-e011-4813-8385-0da404e939e4","time_seconds":600},{"id":"466c3a22-31db-4e53-92c4-c65f097df3e9","text":"燒熱鑊後下少量油，放入土豆丁中火煎炒 2 至 3 分鐘，炒至邊位微微金黃。","step_no":3,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"789c4dc7-e011-4813-8385-0da404e939e4","time_seconds":180},{"id":"adef935b-a953-4411-b2b3-7f9e7f4adbc9","text":"加入 2 至 3 湯匙清水，蓋上鍋蓋中火燜 3 至 4 分鐘，煮至土豆變粉糯，再打開鍋蓋。","step_no":4,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"789c4dc7-e011-4813-8385-0da404e939e4","time_seconds":240},{"id":"2d4768f5-3333-4c44-a83f-3fa71ba30d87","text":"將土豆撥到一旁，補少許油，加入蒜蓉和辣椒炒香，再放入免治豬肉炒散至轉色熟透。","step_no":5,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"789c4dc7-e011-4813-8385-0da404e939e4","time_seconds":150},{"id":"698c7ac4-56f4-41e0-802d-d852341ae09e","text":"加入生抽、老抽和糖，將肉末與土豆一同炒勻；如果太乾，可加少量清水幫助收汁。","step_no":6,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"789c4dc7-e011-4813-8385-0da404e939e4","time_seconds":90},{"id":"770bc04c-0431-48de-9b6a-614d1c79ec22","text":"最後加入蔥花快速拌勻，即可上碟。","step_no":7,"image_url":null,"recipe_id":"789c4dc7-e011-4813-8385-0da404e939e4","time_seconds":30}],"recipe":{"name":"薯仔炒肉碎","description":"薯仔先煎炒再炆至綿軟，配蒜香肉碎及微甜醬汁，鹹香惹味。","calories_per_serving":360,"protein_g":18,"carbs_g":28,"fat_g":18,"diet":["low_calorie"],"flavor":["salty"],"protein":["pork"],"primary_protein":"pork","source_data":{"consistency_review":{"date":"2026-10-25","scope":"full_legacy_text_consistency","status":"pending_evidence","public_notes":["原始食譜來源及營養依據尚未核實；本輪只核對材料表與文字的一致性，並非試煮或完整營養驗證。","做法仍提及材料表未列的生抽、食油、蔥、鹽及白胡椒；不可直接假設用量。"],"nutrition_validated":false,"original_source_verified":false}}},"ingredients":[{"id":"9de69b78-3202-461a-b7ea-82115da82598","name":"蒜頭","note":null,"slug":"garlic","unit":"g","optional":false,"quantity":10},{"id":"a6c16deb-1d2e-4de9-bf15-0cc457eff721","name":"糖","note":null,"slug":"sugar","unit":"g","optional":false,"quantity":5},{"id":"7784627c-1326-4bdd-9acb-0d1b9fdb4f2a","name":"豬肉碎","note":